			"notes": "# **Changelog - Version 1.0.2**  \n\n## **New Features**  \n- **Custom Dimension Spawns** → You can now set specific spawn points for each dimension!  \n- **Dimension Disabling** → Prevent teleportation to certain dimensions using `/dimensionalroulette dimensions disable <dimension>`.  \n- **Dimension Enabling** → Re-enable a disabled dimension using `/dimensionalroulette dimensions enable <dimension>`.  \n\n## **Fixes & Improvements**  \n- **Fixed teleportation logic** → The random teleportation now respects custom spawns.  \n- **Commands are now properly structured** → No more `/dimensions dimensions disable` issue.  \n- **General stability improvements and bug fixes**."
		},
