			"notes": "**Dimensional Roulette 1.21.1-1.0.1** 🎲✨  \n\n- **New Commands!** Toggle teleportation and switch between **spawn modes** (`spawn` or `relative`).  \n- **Improved Safety!** Now detects if you're **stuck inside blocks** and carves out a **3×3 escape room**.  \n- **Instant Platforms!** If you spawn **mid-air**, a **stone platform** is created immediately.  \n- **Bedrock Handling!** Spawning on **bedrock?** It now gets **replaced with stone** to prevent getting trapped.  \n\n⚡ **More chaos, more control!** Let the dimensions decide your fate. 🌌"
		},
